[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_3A_CANNON]
Cannon

[l_english.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_3A_CANNON_desc]
Our air force cannon is commanded by an air force major, so that’s “A Major Cannon” (A for Airforce).

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_3A_CANNON]
加农炮

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_PLANE_WEAPON_AIRATK_3A_CANNON_desc]
我们的空军加农炮，由一名空军 (Airforce) 上校 (Major) 指挥，所以这就是“A大调加农炮”。
